          "width": 508,
          "height": 384,
          "content": "Recent Activity tile:\n\nDisplay the 5 most recent transactions from the Activity page.\n\nFor each transaction, display:\n- Merchant Logo / Icon\n- Date\n- Merchant / Description\n- Transaction Amount\n\nPositive amounts should display with a “+” sign, in the colors-text-deposit color.\nNegative amounts should display with a “-” sign, and remain in the colors-text-body color."
